      <h2>Alabama trust law in brief</h2>
      <p>Behind the paperwork sits state law. How Alabama treats trust execution, business trusts, favorable trust provisions, and what makes the state unusual. Every one of those four topics is documented in full on the <a href="/certificate-of-trust/alabama/">Certificate of Trust for Alabama</a> page, which covers the same statutory record from the certification side. This page keeps the declaration-specific material: how the instrument is executed, what goes wrong most often, and the answers to the questions below.</p>
